<Routine Name="station_mgr" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[The station_mgr routine is called off a FOR loop in the main routine to go through each stations_array entry and check
if the vehicle_mgr detected any vehicle arriving at said station (by setting active_vehicle_id field non-zero) and act on the vehicle's arrival:
either dwell for the dwell period, or go straight to the depart state to assign the vehicle's vehicle_mgr_array entry dest_station_id field to
a new station to head to.

When in the STATION_STATE_IDLE, and the hold_flag isn't set, if this station entry's active_vehicle_id goes non-zero, a vehicle
arrived here.  Ifwe have a non-zero dwell period, schedule the dwell and go to STATION_STATE_DWELL
otherwise go to the STATION_STATE_DEPART state to get the vehicle on to the next_station_id field.

The station_mgr and vehicle_mgr work hand-in-hand to move vehicles from station to station stored here in
PLC memory only which can be more convenient than defining all of your stations with the HLC XML file.
This is a technique used at MMI we pass on as a example for convenience to those looking for example logic
to do a station to station based setup.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[s].state,STATION_STATE_IDLE)XIO(stations_array[s].station_hold_flag)NEQ(stations_array[s].active_vehicle_id,0)[NEQ(stations_array[s].dwell_period,0) [MOV(stations_array[s].dwell_period,stations_array[s].timer.PRE) ,RES(stations_array[s].timer) ,MOV(STATION_STATE_DWELL,stations_array[s].state) ] ,EQU(stations_array[s].dwell_period,0) MOV(STATION_STATE_PROCESSING,stations_array[s].state) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When we're in the STATION_STATE_DWELL, pet the dwell timer, check if it's done, and when done go to STATION_STATE_DEPART]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[s].state,STATION_STATE_DWELL)[TON(stations_array[s].timer,?,?) ,XIC(stations_array[s].timer.DN) XIO(simulateMachine) MOV(STATION_STATE_PROCESSING,stations_array[s].state) ,XIC(stations_array[s].timer.DN) XIC(simulateMachine) OTL(stations_array[s].process_complete) MOV(STATION_STATE_PROCESSING,stations_array[s].state) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When in STATION_STATE_DEPART, save a copy of the vehicle_id that arrived here in active_vehicle_id and set the dest_station_id of the vehicle_mgr_array entry for
the vehicle sitting here to our next_station_id field so the vehicle will take off (taken care of by vehicle_mgr).
If clear_loaded_flag is set, clear the loaded_flag field for this vehicle in vehicle_mgr_array entry
If set_loaded_flag is set for this station, set the loaded_flag for this vehicle in vehicle_mgr_array_entry.
Finally, go back to STATION_STATE_IDLE to wait for the vehicle_mgr to populate us with a new active_vehicle_id (it will go non-zero).
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[s].state,STATION_STATE_DEPART)[MOV(stations_array[s].active_vehicle_id,active_vehicle_id) MOV(stations_array[s].next_station_id,vehicle_mgr_array[active_vehicle_id].dest_station_id) ,MOV(stations_array[s].PID_set,vehicle_mgr_array[active_vehicle_id].PID_set) ,MOV(0,stations_array[s].active_vehicle_id) MOV(STATION_STATE_IDLE,stations_array[s].state) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="station_processing" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==========================================================
HOME STATION (33)
========================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[33].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[33].state);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[===================================================
MOLD 1: 
1 - Pre Station - (1)
2 - Removed (2&3)
2 - Place Stations (4&5)
1 - Cooling Station (6)
===================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[1].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[1].state);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(System.Zone1.Cycle.Mode) ,XIO(System.Zone1.Cycle.Mode) XIC(System.Zone2.Cycle.Mode) ] ,XIC(simulateMachine) ][XIO(simulateMachine) XIC(\Station_10_A13.Status.Complete) XIO(RBT10_760.i.ProgReq.26) ,XIC(simulateMachine) ]XIC(stations_array[4].occupied)XIC(stations_array[5].occupied)[OTE(stations_array[4].process_complete) ,CTU(test,?,?) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[2].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)XIO(stations_array[4].occupied)XIO(stations_array[5].occupied)[MOV(5,stations_array[2].next_station_id) OTL(stations_array[5].occupied) ,MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[2].state) ]CTU(test4,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[2].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)XIO(stations_array[4].occupied)XIC(stations_array[5].occupied)[MOV(4,stations_array[2].next_station_id) OTL(stations_array[4].occupied) ,MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[2].state) ]CTU(test5,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(simulateMachine) ,XIC(simulateMachine) XIC(startSim) ]EQU(stations_array[4].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)EQU(stations_array[5].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)XIC(stations_array[4].process_complete)[MOV(13,stations_array[4].next_station_id) CTU(test2,?,?) [XIO(stations_array[6].occupied) MOV(6,stations_array[5].next_station_id) ,XIC(stations_array[6].occupied) MOV(13,stations_array[5].next_station_id) ] OTU(stations_array[4].occupied) OTU(stations_array[5].occupied) OTL(stations_array[6].occupied) OTU(stations_array[4].process_complete) ,XIO(stations_array[4].occupied) XIO(stations_array[5].occupied) MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[4].state) MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[5].state) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[6].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)TON(GeneralTimers[4],?,?)XIC(GeneralTimers[4].DN)[MOV(13,stations_array[6].next_station_id) OTU(stations_array[6].process_complete) OTU(stations_array[6].occupied) ,MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[6].state) ]CTU(test3,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[===================================================
MOLD 2: 
1 - Pre Station - (7)
2 - Removed (8&9)
2 - Place Stations (10&11)
1 - Cooling Station (12)
===================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(System.Zone1.Cycle.Mode) ,XIO(System.Zone1.Cycle.Mode) XIC(System.Zone3.Cycle.Mode) ] ,XIC(simulateMachine) ][XIO(simulateMachine) XIC(\Station_20_A12.Status.Complete) XIO(RBT10_765.i.ProgReq.26) ,XIC(simulateMachine) ]XIC(stations_array[10].occupied)XIC(stations_array[11].occupied)OTE(stations_array[10].process_complete);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[7].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)XIO(stations_array[10].occupied)XIO(stations_array[11].occupied)[MOV(11,stations_array[7].next_station_id) OTL(stations_array[11].occupied) ,MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[7].state) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(stations_array[7].state,STATION_STATE_PROCESSING)XIO(stations_array[10].occupied)XIC(stations_array[11].occupied)[MOV(10,stations_array[7].next_station_id) OTL(stations_array[10].occupied) ,MOV(STATION_STATE_DEPART,stations_array[7].state) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
